  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "match": {
            "title": "Nostalgia"
          }
        },
        {
          "range": {
            "year": {
              "gte": "2000"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}

response = es.search(index="movies", body=query)
```

This Elasticsearch query searches for movies with the title "Nostalgia" that were released after the year 2000. The `bool` must clause ensures that both conditions are met. This is useful if you're looking for a specific genre or time period while also exploring the theme of nostalgia in films.
